    <string name="tips_1">1. On the Model page, pick a provider and enter its API key (on-device TTS needs none)</string>
    <string name="tips_2">2. Pick a voice; if none fits, tap ＋ to clone one from a sample</string>
    <string name="tips_3">3. Enter text then Generate; a record can be played, refilled, shared or downloaded</string>
